I never agree this kind of suggestion.
I like the evil guy who caused the war continuously.
( Certainly I am not the person. )
If you hate him, you could let him go to hell as you like.
But ES is similar to the real world.
Wizards should take care of all kinds of players(including evil ones).
By your suggestion, I think it's unfair( or fault fair ).
In my opinion, dangers are normal and needful in ES.
If you died because of some danger. All I can say is :
YOU ARE POOR AND UNFORTUNATE.
BUT REMOVING DANGERS IS PLAYERS' JOB, NOT OURS(WIZARDS').


